        "original_id": "19c520c5-f48d-5344-a4cd-8eb708a258a4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ross Case, Slobodan Živojinović\n- Events: 1974 Pacific Coast Open, 1985 Australian Open, 1986 Wimbledon Championships\n- Roles: former tennis player, singles player\n- Concepts: world ranking, prize money, Grand Prix points\n\nFacts:\n- Ross Case was born on 1 November 1951.\n- Ross Case is an Australian former tennis player.\n- In 1974, unseeded Ross Case won the singles title at the 1974 Pacific Coast Open.\n- In 1974, Ross Case received $16,000 in first-prize money and 80 Grand Prix points for winning the 1974 Pacific Coast Open singles title.\n- In 1985, Slobodan Živojinović reached the singles semi-finals of the Australian Open.\n- In 1986, Slobodan Živojinović reached the singles semi-finals of Wimbledon Championships.\n- Slobodan Živojinović achieved a career-high singles ranking of World No. 19.",
